# IMPORTANT: FILES WE INTENTIONALLY DO NOT IGNORE
# ==============================================================================

# Keep research source code:
# *.py
#
# Keep shell/reproduction scripts:
# *.sh
#
# Keep notebooks if they are part of the research:
# *.ipynb
#
# Keep dependency/environment specifications:
# requirements.txt
# environment.yml
# pyproject.toml
#
# Keep curated final research results:
# results/
#
# Suggested structure:
#
# results/
# ├── tables/
# └── figures/
#
# Generated/raw experiment artifacts should stay under outputs/
# and are therefore ignored.